@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title Private-file access sequence
actor Requester
participant "ResumeFileController" as Files
participant Resume
participant Session
database "Private filesystem" as Disk
Requester -> Files : GET resume-files/{resume}/{type}/{certificate?}
Files -> Files : Determine authenticated owner or admin
alt Owner or admin
 note right of Files
Public status, grant and uploaded-mode
checks are bypassed for these requesters.
end note
else Public requester
 Files -> Resume : Check active status (otherwise 404)
 Files -> Resume : allowsPublicAccess(request)
 Resume -> Session : Compare stored grant with current token
 note right of Files
Failed access returns 403.
Uploaded PDF requires uploaded/both mode.
end note
end
Files -> Resume : Resolve photo, uploaded PDF or scoped certificate
note right of Resume
Certificate lookup is through resume.certificates.
A certificate belonging to another resume is not selected.
end note
Files -> Disk : Check path and existence (otherwise 404)
Files -> Disk : Stream authorized file
Files --> Requester : Response with X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
@enduml
